ardKit\/UIKit\/UITextDocumentProxy"},{"type":"text","text":" to modify text, move the text input cursor, get input-related info, etc."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy will by default only send text to the host application, and will "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" let you type into a text field in the keyboard extension. Even if you select a text field in the keyboard extension, the typed text will still be sent to the host application."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"KeyboardKit Pro unlocks special text input fields that will hijack the text document proxy, to automatically let you type within a keyboard.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"👑 KeyboardKit Pro unlocks "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/ProFeature\/textInput","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" views that let you type within the keyboard, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Vietnamese","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" support that let you type with TELEX, VNI and VIQR. You can sign up for KeyboardKit Pro from the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/keyboardkit.com","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"style":"important"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Input Engines","anchor":"Input-Engines"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"KeyboardKit Pro unlocks specific text input engines for certain languages, and inject them into the main ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardActionHandler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"🇰🇷 Korean Input","type":"heading","anchor":"%F0%9F%87%B0%F0%9F%87%B7-Korean-Input","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"KeyboardKi